     "body": "<p>Per discussion in slack.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>All actions within a transaction will result in the creation of a single version, if auto-versioning is enabled.</li>\n\t<li>If auto-versioning is not enabled, the updates go in mutable-head.</li>\n\t<li>Requests to create versions within transactions are prohibited.</li>\n\t<li>Specifying a timestamp and POST content is no longer supported.</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "04/Mar/20 4:06 PM",
     "id": "21077",
     "jsdPublic": true,
